    "attributes": {
        "action": "Create a Clear National Early\u2011Stage Charity Pathway",
        "additional_details": "Businesses can register in minutes, but community groups often wait months before they can begin lawful, safe public\u2011benefit activity. We ask the Government to introduce a national early\u2011stage charity pathway that provides clear guidance, consistent processes, and timely support for new community groups. A clear pathway would maintain safeguards while reducing unnecessary delays, helping volunteers support vulnerable people, strengthening communities, improving early intervention, and increasing homelessness\u2011prevention capacity.",
        "background": "Create a clear, nationally consistent early\u2011stage charity pathway so community groups can begin lawful, safe public\u2011benefit activity without long delays.",
